OL,3,GNEWSAMore schools shut for strikes over
OL,4,ACatholic academy plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore schools across the north-west of
OL,7,FEngland have been affected by strike
OL,8,Faction over plans to take them into
OL,9,Facademy trusts.
OL,11,FTwo Catholic schools, in Preston and in
OL,12,FFleetwood, were set to be closed on
OL,13,FMonday and Tuesday, following on from
OL,14,Fsimilar strike action on Merseyside
OL,15,Fearlier this month.
OL,17,FThe National Education Union (NEU) has
OL,18,Fclaimed plans for every Catholic school
OL,19,Fin the Diocese Of Lancaster to become
OL,20,Fan academy would drain vital funds away
OL,21,Ffrom the classroom and see teacher
OL,22,Fnumbers cut.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
